Z||000000||84se48||05-11-2001||10:10 PM||||HELP-----I'm new to the forum,first time. My problem is,when I come to a quick stop,the engine dies and the starter won't work til I guess? the engine cools down,say a half hour. Temp is just above 100 mark. I have an '84 se,2.5 auto. I have a million questions but this one is driving  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> me nuts!!! Can anybody help???????||||reg||9
Z||000001||Vlad||05-11-2001||10:32 PM||||Yes, we can.<P>Search for old topics about TCC (Transmission Control Solenoid).<P>Guess you will find all answers you need.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroJoe||05-11-2001||10:37 PM||||Welcome!<P>Explain in more detail what you mean by the starter not working when the car is hot.  Will it click when you turn the key, but just not crank?  And are there any other visible signs when this happens, like flickering/fading dash lights and radio, or any other electrical things?<P>I guess the easiest thing to check right now is your battery connections.  Car dying when coming to a "quick stop" seems wierd if it only does it then, and not when you stop slowly.<P>So check those battery connections, and make sure the starter connections are clean and tight.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000003||Wolfhound||05-11-2001||10:39 PM||||Search last three days. TCC<BR>Coy||||reg||14
Z||000004||84se48||05-12-2001||12:56 PM||||Hi, First time it happened,(I live on a hill) I wasn't going fast,but I have to push down hard on the gas. when I got to the top, I took my foot off the gas fast and hit the brakes,car died.(no start). Second time,just out crusing. stopped at store,felt like car was serging,(tech up&down about 6-7 hundered rpm) Shut off engine. Came out of store,no start.Thought starter went out.Turn key nothing happened,no click,no nothing. Sat there about 1 hr. started right up.Yesterday, comming home from work,down freeway@about75mph(short off ramp)stood on brakes, came to stop,engine died. sat half hr started right up. I think the people who had this car before,(they traded it in)must have had the same problem.They added a push button? Turn key-push button. No visible signs like flickering electrical things.Read (TCC)only thing I notice about trany is it seems to shift too soon,lugging down engine. the reason I think this is because,the engine pings so bad,one would think I had a diesel. I will try disconecting the TCC and see what happens.thanks                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            